{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude18Face To Face is a\u00a0satisfying action puzzle game that combines the Physics of Suika Game with a SUPER COOL Set Matching mechanic.\ud83d\ude05 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe6<strong>How to Play\ud83d\udfea</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Tap Shapes to give them a face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. When faces touch, They kiss and disappear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Faces can kiss through other objects, as long as each shape has one thing in common with the one before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(this would be a valid example -&gt; \ud83d\ude18\ud83d\udfe1\ud83d\udfe2\ud83d\udfe9\ud83d\udfe8\ud83d\ude05)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Create longer chains for more points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe6<strong>About the developer\ud83d\udfea</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Samuel Leigh is a game developer, writer and adjunct professor based in New York. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His work spans from Interactive fiction, to puzzle and action games. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His other games, Conversation with a Rock, Annoy this Guy, The Way Down, Blow Out and Moving Jigsaw Puzzles can be played on Steam now!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"So Bad It's Impressive!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220610/04f7bd2f3b0b5f42daea9dfa060516ac5663483e.jpg"},{"name":"20 Chains","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220610/04f7bd2f3b0b5f42daea9dfa060516ac5663483e.jpg"},{"name":"Shake!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220610/04f7bd2f3b0b5f42daea9dfa060516ac5663483e.jpg"},{"name":"Life in the DANGER ZONE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220610/04f7bd2f3b0b5f42daea9dfa060516ac5663483e.jpg"},{"name":"uh..no